      en: ["Lahan is the largest city in the Siraha District.", "The Mahendra Highway divides the city into two halves.", "Phulbari Garden is home to an orchid that blooms only once a year on the 1st of Baisakh.", "The Sagarmatha Choudhary Eye Hospital in Lahan is internationally recognized.", "The city is situated at an elevation of approximately 110 meters above sea level.", "Lahan is a key hub for trade with India via the Thadi border crossing."],
